# Project specification

The searchable specification is `docs/spec/metro-is-just-a-bus.md` (statement v1.0, 2026-09-29). The original PDF is in `docs/spec/`. An identical copy lives in `metro-core`; when updating the statement, update both.

Permanent agent context (SDD): `.ai/steering/` (`product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, `conventions.md`, `principles.md`) and `AGENTS.md`.

## What to read when

- **Default (UI implementation):** `.ai/steering/` and `AGENTS.md`. Do not load the full statement only for deadlines or grading.
- **Milestone / delivery / grading / alignment checks:** read `docs/spec/metro-is-just-a-bus.md` (milestones and evaluation criteria). PDF prevails on conflict.
- **Flows or API contracts while coding:** steering plus Technical Description of the statement as needed.

Before deciding passenger- or ops-visible behavior or contracts with other components, read steering (and the statement when relevant).

This application is the single web client for passengers and operational staff (role-based). The system must be distributed: core, supporting services, and notifications do not all live inside this app. Do not implement domain rules here — consume `metro-core` APIs.
